{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"title":"WorkPerformance.Event","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"externalID":"s:10IvorExtern15WorkPerformanceV5EventV","symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"IvorExtern"}],"extendedModule":"IvorExtern","roleHeading":"Structure"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/event"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Events at the same time are ordered note-offs first, then bank"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"selects (MSB, then LSB), then program changes, then pan (MSB, then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"LSB), then expression (MSB, then LSB), then pedals (CC 64–68), then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any other control change, then note-ons, so that a note repeated back"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to back sounds again — with its new instrument, pan and expression,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if they change there — and a pedal goes down before a note it should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hold. Notes that end where a pedal is re-pedaled are let go of first,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while the pedal is still down, so its release frees them."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conf